{
  "turn_number": 2,
  "player_text": "“Northwest of which crates, exactly—and who first found those footprints? Also, you missed my other questions: where can I sleep cheaply and find work?”",
  "visible_motivation": "Clarify the patrol's trail while pressing for practical shelter and employment information.",
  "intended_meaning": "Get precise directions, identify a witness, and obtain leads on lodging and work.",
  "generation_attempt_1": "\"I'm afraid I can't say which crates those were northwest of, nor who exactly found the footprints first,\" the tavern runner says with a shrug, eyes flicking to the damp, cluttered area beyond the gate. \"Those details haven't filtered back to me yet. As for cheap lodging and work, your best bet might be to ask around in the Market Quarter—it's a rough place, but there's usually a handful of scrappy inns and some day labor if you keep your ears open.\"",
